                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I dusted this game back off because I'm going through and playing the speedrunning games in my library. This silly little game has every right to stand aside the greats of this genre, the Counter-Strike: Sources and the VHOLUMEs. \r\n\r\nIt's got more interesting momentum than most games. Very icy. You really have to get your character going, it's harder to change direction, and you've got no coyote time. All that means is you've got to plan ahead a little. And if you do, the grind is so rewarding. What a fun game!",
